{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52853","headline":"驾幸天安宫赋附邑老田父歌 · 吕令问","name":"驾幸天安宫赋附邑老田父歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岁既稔而时清，我后来兮应天行。\n东都士庶扶轮送，西土诸侯扫地迎。\n君之德兮德无有，路旁劳赉皆牛酒。\n乘舆一至长安城，千秋万岁南山寿。\n（见前书卷五八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕令问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}